  <TM_MechaGolem_Workstation.label>休眠的机械傀儡</TM_MechaGolem_Workstation.label>
  <!--原中文: '休眠的机械傀儡。机械傀儡的设计将工业工程与魔法属性相结合，使它的结构栩栩如生。这个傀儡可以利用现有的电网来加快充能速度。除了携带某人和清洁等基本任务外，机械傀儡还可以配备采矿激光，以快速钻穿可开采的岩石。机械傀儡将工业和简单武器及装甲结合到它的武器库中。\n\n在休眠期间，傀儡可以会被修改或升级。机械傀儡会自行进行缓慢充能，但获得电源将提高充能速度。当电力不足时，傀儡也可以向电网提供能量。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A dormant mecha-golem. Mecha golem design combines industrial engineering with magical attributes to bring to life a robotic construct. This golem can tap into existing power grids to speed charge rate. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the mecha golem can be equipped with a mining laser to rapidly drill through mine-able rock. Mecha golems combine both industrial and simple weaponry and armor into its arsenal.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The mecha-golem recharges energy slowly on its own but access to power sources will increase the recharge speed. The golem may also provide energy to an electrical grid when there is an electrical deficit.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A dormant mecha-golem. Mecha golem design combines industrial engineering with magical attributes to bring to life a robotic construct. This golem can tap into existing power grids to speed charge rate. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the mecha golem can be equipped with a mining laser to rapidly drill through mine-able rock. Mecha golems combine both industrial and simple weaponry and armor into its arsenal.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The mecha-golem recharges energy slowly on its own but access to power sources will increase the recharge speed. The golem may also provide energy to an electrical grid when there is an electrical deficit.-->
  <TM_MechaGolem_Workstation.description>休眠的机械傀儡。机械傀儡的设计将工业工程与魔法属性相结合，使它的结构栩栩如生。这个傀儡可以利用现有的电网来加快充能速度。除了携带某人和清洁等基本任务外，机械傀儡还可以配备采矿激光，以快速钻穿可开采的岩石。机械傀儡将工业和简单武器及装甲结合到它的武器库中。\n\n在休眠期间，傀儡可以会被修改或升级。机械傀儡会自行进行缓慢充能，但获得电源将提高充能速度。当电力不足时，傀儡也可以向电网提供能量。</TM_MechaGolem_Workstation.description>
