  <TM_FleshGolem_Workstation.label>休眠的血肉傀儡</TM_FleshGolem_Workstation.label>
  <!--原中文: '休眠的血肉傀儡。血肉傀儡是一种类似两足动物的有机物质，主要由死去生物的身体部位组成。血肉傀儡是一个可怕的战士，拥有各种各样的攻击和能力来进一步提高其杀伤力。除了搬运和清洁等基本任务外，血肉傀儡还可以使用附带的切割器收割树木或植物\n\n休眠期间，傀儡可以会被修改或升级。血肉傀儡会自己缓慢地重新充能，但提供新鲜的肉会增加能量的充能速度。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A dormant flesh golem. Flesh golems are a bipedal-like mass of organic matter, mostly comprised of body parts from deceased creatures. The flesh golem is a fearsome combatant with a variety of attacks and abilities that further increase its lethality. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the flesh golem is able to use attached cleavers to harvest trees or plants. 
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The flesh golem recharges energy slowly on its own but supplying it with fresh meat will increase the recharge speed.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A dormant flesh golem. Flesh golems are a bipedal-like mass of organic matter, mostly comprised of body parts from deceased creatures. The flesh golem is a fearsome combatant with a variety of attacks and abilities that further increase its lethality. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the flesh golem is able to use attached cleavers to harvest trees or plants. 
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The flesh golem recharges energy slowly on its own but supplying it with fresh meat will increase the recharge speed.-->
  <TM_FleshGolem_Workstation.description>休眠的血肉傀儡。血肉傀儡是一种类似两足动物的有机物质，主要由死去生物的身体部位组成。血肉傀儡是一个可怕的战士，拥有各种各样的攻击和能力来进一步提高其杀伤力。除了搬运和清洁等基本任务外，血肉傀儡还可以使用附带的切割器收割树木或植物\n\n休眠期间，傀儡可以会被修改或升级。血肉傀儡会自己缓慢地重新充能，但提供新鲜的肉会增加能量的充能速度。</TM_FleshGolem_Workstation.description>
