  <TM_HollowGolem_Workstation.label>休眠的空洞傀儡</TM_HollowGolem_Workstation.label>
  <!--原中文: '休眠的空洞傀儡。空洞傀儡是一种法力聚合体，并用各种盔甲捆绑在它身上以保护它。在休眠状态下，空洞傀儡看起来像一套空盔甲。这个傀儡吸取周围环境的法力来为自己提供能量，这会导致所有法师的法力恢复速度降低，甚至降到负数。这种降低加上现有的法师数量和现有的潘希斑构成总体法力回复速度。除了搬运和清洁等基本任务外，空洞傀儡还变成一种设施，以提供光线、增加研究速度，并充当迫击炮。作为一个充满活力的法力生物，他们能够驾驭多种形式的魔法能量，而不受那些人类法师使用魔法的副作用的影响。\n\n休眠期间，傀儡可以被修改或升级。空洞傀儡自己会缓慢地充能，但可以通过切换状态来从附近的法师那里吸取法力。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A dormant hollow golem. Hollow golems are a combination of condensed mana tethered and protected by various pieces of armor. In it's dormant form, the hollow golem appears as an empty suite of armor. This golem draws on ambient mana to fuel itself which can cause an overall reduction, even negative, mana regeneration rates for mages. This reduction is combined with existing mages and paracyte thorn bushes. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the hollow golem can be outfitted to provide light, increase research, and act as a mortar system. Being a creature of animated mana, they are able to harness multiple forms of magical energy, without suffering from human frailties.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The hollow golem recharges energy slowly on its own but may be toggled to receive mana from nearby mages.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: A dormant hollow golem. Hollow golems are a combination of condensed mana tethered and protected by various pieces of armor. In it's dormant form, the hollow golem appears as an empty suite of armor. This golem draws on ambient mana to fuel itself which can cause an overall reduction, even negative, mana regeneration rates for mages. This reduction is combined with existing mages and paracyte thorn bushes. In addition to basic tasks such as hauling and cleaning, the hollow golem can be outfitted to provide light, increase research, and act as a mortar system. Being a creature of animated mana, they are able to harness multiple forms of magical energy, without suffering from human frailties.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The hollow golem recharges energy slowly on its own but may be toggled to receive mana from nearby mages.-->
  <TM_HollowGolem_Workstation.description>休眠的空洞傀儡。空洞傀儡是一种法力聚合体，并用各种盔甲捆绑在它身上以保护它。在休眠状态下，空洞傀儡看起来像一套空盔甲。这个傀儡吸取周围环境的法力来为自己提供能量，这会导致所有法师的法力恢复速度降低，甚至降到负数。这种降低加上现有的法师数量和现有的潘希斑构成总体法力回复速度。除了搬运和清洁等基本任务外，空洞傀儡还变成一种设施，以提供光线、增加研究速度，并充当迫击炮。作为一个充满活力的法力生物，他们能够驾驭多种形式的魔法能量，而不受那些人类法师使用魔法的副作用的影响。\n\n休眠期间，傀儡可以被修改或升级。空洞傀儡自己会缓慢地充能，但可以通过切换状态来从附近的法师那里吸取法力。</TM_HollowGolem_Workstation.description>
