  <TM_StoneGolem_Workstation.label>休眠的巨岩傀儡</TM_StoneGolem_Workstation.label>
  <!--原中文: '休眠的巨岩傀儡，利用傀儡学的基本原理，将将岩石和石头做成人形的简单构造物。 尽管简单而廉价，巨岩傀儡是未经精炼的，并严重依赖魔法符文的移动。岩石的质量和对魔法力量的依赖使石傀儡缓慢，但很难摧毁。 在其休眠状态下，石像可以通过一个岩石魔炉将岩石压碎并将其塑造成砖块。 这个过程需要能量和石头块被放置到傀儡中。\n	\n休眠期间，傀儡可以被修改或升级。空洞傀儡自己会缓慢地充能，需要10秒钟才能被激活', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Stone golems apply the basic principles of golemancy and are simple constructs of rock and stone fashioned into humanoid shape. Though simple and inexpensive, the stone golem is unrefined and relies heavily on magical runes for mobility. The material weight and reliance on magical power for animation make the stone golem slow, but difficult to destroy. In its dormant form, the stone golem can be enhanced with a rock compactor, which is an automated process that crushes rock and shapes it into bricks. This process requires energy and the stone chunks to be deposited into the golem.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The stone golem recharges energy slowly on its own. This golem takes up to 10 seconds to activate.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Stone golems apply the basic principles of golemancy and are simple constructs of rock and stone fashioned into humanoid shape. Though simple and inexpensive, the stone golem is unrefined and relies heavily on magical runes for mobility. The material weight and reliance on magical power for animation make the stone golem slow, but difficult to destroy. In its dormant form, the stone golem can be enhanced with a rock compactor, which is an automated process that crushes rock and shapes it into bricks. This process requires energy and the stone chunks to be deposited into the golem.
	
While dormant, the golem may be modified or upgraded. The stone golem recharges energy slowly on its own. This golem takes up to 10 seconds to activate.-->
  <TM_StoneGolem_Workstation.description>休眠的巨岩傀儡，利用傀儡学的基本原理，将将岩石和石头做成人形的简单构造物。 尽管简单而廉价，巨岩傀儡是未经精炼的，并严重依赖魔法符文的移动。岩石的质量和对魔法力量的依赖使石傀儡缓慢，但很难摧毁。 在其休眠状态下，石像可以通过一个岩石魔炉将岩石压碎并将其塑造成砖块。 这个过程需要能量和石头块被放置到傀儡中。\n	\n休眠期间，傀儡可以被修改或升级。空洞傀儡自己会缓慢地充能，需要10秒钟才能被激活</TM_StoneGolem_Workstation.description>
